  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Export Promotion Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Promocion de Exportaciones</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Fortalecer la capacidad tecnica del pais para promover exportaciones y atraer inversiones de forma coordinada, sistemica y sostenible (con un enfoque en un modelo de gestion por resultados y generacion de ingresos).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support the country&apos;s technical capacity to promote exports and attract investment in a coordinated, systematic and sustainable way (with a focus on result-based management and income generation).</narrative>
  </description>
